From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Berkay=20K=C3=B6sebay?= <brkosebay@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 05:17:39 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: input: apple,z2-multitouch: Add attn-gpios for
 J71t
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The iPad 5 N1 driver reads the attention line (GPIO 65, active low) back
as a GPIO: frames are read while it stays asserted, and an empty queue
with the line still asserted is an error. Requesting it as an input also
configures the pin as one. Allow an optional attn-gpios on the J71t
touchscreen.

Signed-off-by: Berkay Kösebay <brkosebay@users.noreply.github.com>
[Orchard: from brkosebay/linux e623b3c6, 39c86d64 (J71t ledger 8.1);
 his apple,j71t-n1 binding's attn-gpios, restored on the z2 binding
 after an independent comparison with his validated driver.]
Co-developed-by: Henrik Klee <henrik@goat-code.com>
Signed-off-by: Henrik Klee <henrik@goat-code.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../bindings/input/touchscreen/apple,z2-multitouch.yaml   | 8 ++++++++
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/touchscreen/apple,z2-multitouch.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/touchscreen/apple,z2-multitouch.yaml
index 1f5801674..f42b596c2 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/touchscreen/apple,z2-multitouch.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/touchscreen/apple,z2-multitouch.yaml
@@ -29,6 +29,12 @@ properties:
   reset-gpios:
     maxItems: 1
 
+  attn-gpios:
+    maxItems: 1
+    description:
+      The controller's attention (interrupt) line, read back as a GPIO to
+      see whether reports are still pending
+
   power-ana-gpios:
     maxItems: 1
 
@@ -204,6 +210,7 @@ allOf:
     else:
       properties:
         ana-supply: false
+        attn-gpios: false
   - if:
       properties:
         compatible:
@@ -255,6 +262,7 @@ examples:
             reg = <0>;
             spi-max-frequency = <12048192>;
             interrupts-extended = <&pinctrl_ap 65 IRQ_TYPE_EDGE_FALLING>;
+            attn-gpios = <&pinctrl_ap 65 GPIO_ACTIVE_LOW>;
             reset-gpios = <&pinctrl_ap 75 GPIO_ACTIVE_LOW>;
             power-ldo-gpios = <&pinctrl_ap 73 GPIO_ACTIVE_HIGH>;
             ana-supply = <&touch_analog>;
